# Namespaces

Modules that export **only** functions or types must use an `export namespace`. No top-level function exports.

**Exception:** React components stay as named function exports (`export function Button`), not inside a namespace.

```ts
// ✅ GOOD — logic module
export namespace ColorUtils {
  export function hexToRgb(hex: string) { ... }
}

// ✅ GOOD — React component
export function Button(props: Props) { ... }

// ❌ BAD — loose function export
export function hexToRgb(hex: string) { ... }
```
